# area 59: the commando is woken, frozen with the dark beam (the frozen reaction's flags are
# 1|2 = 3), then killed, then hit again: the KnockBack override's dead arm.  The steps are wall
# times, not frames: under gdb the frames are slow and a @f step can come after the run's end.
@40 objs commando
@60 send u065a Activate
@100 damage u065a 5 darkburst
@140 kill u065a
@180 damage u065a 5
@220 objs commando
